OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for driving weeks after
OL,4,Afatal crash sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man whose lack of concentration
OL,7,Fcaused a crash that killed his
OL,8,Fpassenger has been jailed after he was
OL,9,Fspotted driving just weeks after being
OL,10,Fdisqualified.
OL,12,FMichael Ronner, 40, of Courtney Road in
OL,13,FKingswood near Bristol, was handed a
OL,14,Fsuspended six-month prison sentence in
OL,15,FJune for a crash that killed Tyler
OL,16,FCarley. Ronner was also banned from
OL,17,Fdriving for 18 months.
OL,19,FJust weeks after the June sentencing,
OL,20,Fan officer said it was "beyond
OL,21,Ffrustrating" to then spot Ronner
OL,22,Fdriving in Mangotsfield again.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
